<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Pick Selection</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Select &gt; Region &gt; Pick Entity</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">or from the</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>toolbar</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">. If</span> <span class="Button">Pick Selection</span> <span lang="EN-GB">is not selected on the toolbar, hold down the left mouse button on the current selection for a second to show up the drop-down toolbar. Select</span> <span class="Button">Pick selection</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button from there.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Pick Selection</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode is selected, press on the toolbar button to activate it.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../images/image284.gif" width="32px" height="32px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt="">Mouse pointer in</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Pick Selection</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Then click with the mouse button on an entity in the</span> <u><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="../User_Interface/Viewport.htm">viewport</a></span></u> <span lang="EN-GB">to select it. If you click on area that is common for several entities, then all of them will be selected. When use Pick Selection, all currently selected areas will be deselected.</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">To add Pick selection to the current one h</span>old down the <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Ctrl</b></span> key while drawing with the mouse.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet">To exclude <span lang="EN-GB">Pick</span> selection from the existing one, hold down the <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Alt</b></span> key while drawing with the mouse.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">T</span>he <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Pick</b></span> <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Selection</b></span> mode will remain active until you switch to another mode.</p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This mode is not stored so next time when you run KUBE,</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Polygonal Selection</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">will be selected automatically.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP234998966" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
